{
  "dom_id": "step-9597",
  "name": "Example: \n                    Calculating the Area of a Square From a Diagram",
  "problem": "What is the area of the square shown below?\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14195146/assets/53ab7a043ebbe03245fd0f8e1bf6438897a30d91654b6e51194205e4c302c07f.png)",
  "worked_solution": "The area of a square with sides of length $a$ is given by \n\n$$\n\\mathcal{A} = a^2.\n$$\n\nNote that each side of a grid cell measures $3\\,\\textrm{ft},$ and each side of the shaded square covers $4$ grid cells. So, the length of each side of the shaded square is\n\n$$\na = 3 \\times 4 = 12 \\, \\textrm{ft} .\n$$\n\nTherefore, the area of the shaded square is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & ={a}^{2}={12}^{2}=144\\,{ft}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-9597\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"9597\" steptype=\"example\" contentid=\"2936\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    Example: \n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-9597\" class=\"stepAnchor\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\" name=\"step-3\">Calculating the Area of a Square From a Diagram</a> \n                </div>      \n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"9597\">?</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                <p>What is the area of the square shown below?</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<div id=\"graphic-6cfa5fc00c53e9946c6cd3526a8a15bb\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/6cfa5fc00c53e9946c6cd3526a8a15bb\"></div>\n            </div>     \n\n            <div class=\"explanationHeader\">EXPLANATION</div>\n\n            <div class=\"exampleExplanation\">\n                <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n            